<title>UK: Allgemeine Hypo sets 500 million mark 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Allgemeine Hypo sets 500 million mark 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    03.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.63     PAY DATE  S-06.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 MGT/UND    0.60	SELL CONC  0.90</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 472</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
